---
// @ts-nocheck
/** @typedef {{ title: string; text: string; icon?: string; image?: string; imageAlt?: string }} FeatureItem */
/** @type {{ items?: FeatureItem[]; columns?: "2" | "3" | "4" }} */
const { items = [], columns = "3" } = Astro.props;
const gridClass = columns === "2" ? "grid-2" : columns === "4" ? "grid-4" : "grid-3";
const featureItems = /** @type {FeatureItem[]} */ (items);
---

<div class={`grid ${gridClass}`}>
  {
    featureItems.map((/** @type {FeatureItem} */ item) => (
      <article class="surface-card feature-card">
        {item.icon && <img src={item.icon} alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />}
        {item.image && <img src={item.image} alt={item.imageAlt || ""} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />}
        <h3>{item.title}</h3>
        <p>{item.text}</p>
      </article>
    ))
  }
</div>
